### Section 5 — Deployable Effective-Wrench Correction Method

**Role in paper**
这是新的核心 Methods。需要把 force correction 和 moment correction 分开讲，并把 deployability constraints 写清楚。

**Key content**
建议分成五个 sub-sections：

1. **Feature construction and deployability**
   `base` features 包括 phase harmonics、alpha、flap frequency、airspeed、q_dyn、phase-regime interactions；再加入 body rates、controls、lateral proxy、interaction features。v2 plan 和 training script 明确这些 feature groups，且目标是不使用 `true_force`、wrench targets、non-deployable labels for inference。([GitHub][9])

2. **Force correction model**
   写成：
   [
   F_{\mathrm{corr}}(x)
   ====================

   F_{\mathrm{prior}}(x)
   +
   \Delta F_\theta(x, F_{\mathrm{prior}})
   ]
   其中 selected force v2 是 affine correction，即 correction 可包含 prior-force interaction terms；不要叫 “black-box NN”。训练脚本中 force model 直接 fit residual target，并在 validation `force_mean` 上选择 additive/affine、feature group 和 alpha。([GitHub][10])

3. **Moment correction model**
   主模型写成：
   [
   M_{\mathrm{corr}}(x)
   ====================

   \hat r(x) \times F_{\mathrm{corr}}(x)
   +
   \hat \tau_{\mathrm{free}}(x)
   ]
   这比 direct residual 更符合“force-arm effective wrench”叙事：moment 不是独立黑箱，而是借助 corrected force 和 learned effective arm/free-torque structure。training script 中 `force_arm` form 明确用 `force_v2` 进行 moment prediction。([GitHub][10])

4. **Model selection protocol**
   强调 model form、feature group、regularization alpha 只在 validation set 上选择；test set 只用于 final reporting。v2 result file 明确 selection used validation RMSE only，deployable metrics/predictions did not use `true_force`。([GitHub][2])

5. **Diagnostic upper bounds**
   如果提到 `true_force` dynamic-arm results，只放在 appendix 或 discussion，并明确是 diagnostic upper bound，不是 deployable result。v2 plan 明确 `true_force` 只能作为 optional diagnostic upper bound，不能用于 final deployable metrics。([GitHub][9])

**Figures/tables**
Main paper：method pipeline schematic + force/moment model block diagram。
Appendix：feature group definitions and hyperparameter grid。

**Safe claims**
“The selected correction is a deployable candidate under the logged-sensor feature set.”
“The moment model uses corrected deployable force, not true force.”
“Validation-only selection reduces test-set tuning risk.”

**Claims to avoid**
避免说 “fully deployable onboard controller” unless 已经上机。
避免说 “causal model of aerodynamic force arm”。
避免把 direct residual / hybrid negative candidates 当作成功结果。

